(420, 'Lantern Rite Special Lotus Seed and Bird Egg Soup', 2, 'Adventurer\'s Dishes', 'Decreases all party members\' sprinting Stamina consumption by 25% for 900s.', 'https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e0/Item_Delicious_Lotus_Seed_and_Bird_Egg_Soup.png'),
